  "cross_tradition_view": "Most of these traditions would likely approve of respecting a boundary and avoiding damage to the tree, while also valuing the consideration of speaking to a neighbor first. They may differ over whether that discourtesy makes the trimming morally wrong or merely inconsiderate; the AI chooses the latter.",
